    "created_at": "2022-05-06T16:00:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-06T16:00:33Z",
    "body": "I think my point is that people shouldn't really be using the term “character” when defining behavior in Web platform specs, so Infra shouldn't be exporting the term and encouraging its use.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/charmod/#sec-PerceptionsOutro",
    "author_association": "NONE",
