    "created_at": "2022-05-06T17:36:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-06T17:36:26Z",
    "body": "Sure, I think people should prefer more precise terms. I don't think that really has bearing on whether it's exported. And it certainly doesn't indicate we should defer to CSS Text (which also exports a definition---and IMO a worse one for the purposes of other specs) instead.",
