    "created_at": "2022-05-09T10:57:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-09T10:57:00Z",
    "body": "I would be okay with a decision where we all avoid using \"character\" going forward and stop exporting it. Note that if we removed the export from Infra, any specifications using this definition might end up accidentally switching to the CSS definition, which does not seem desirable. So any effort to avoid using \"character\" might have to start downstream to some extent.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
